# Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
# Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored. This package ships libraries,
# but it is also the thing an operator builds and runs, and a build made from a
# commit has to be made of the same code every time it is made. See
# docs/WHAT-IT-TALKS-TO.md.

